        "node_id": "n_4_3f26da",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't handle the case where all students have the same skill level correctly. The current approach of checking for a range of 6 around each skill level fails when all skills are identical. Instead, we should simply return the frequency of the most common skill level, which will be the maximum possible team size in this case.",
