      "rev_n_6_cd0c76_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_cd0c76_1",
        "node_id": "n_6_cd0c76",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of sorting the skill levels and using a sliding window is correct, but it doesn't handle the case where the maximum team size could be achieved by including a skill level that's outside the range of the current window. We need to consider the maximum skill in the current window as well as the minimum skill to ensure we're always checking the full range of possible team members.",
