        "node_id": "n_7_83a4b4",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't handle the case where all students have the same skill correctly. The binary search approach was correct, but the feasibility check needed to be adjusted to account for this edge case. Instead of using a binary search on the team size, we can simplify the solution by directly counting the maximum number of students that can be grouped together within the skill difference of 5. This approach will work correctly for all cases, including when all students have the same skill.",
